{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSInteger","text":"NSInteger"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"badge"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"badge","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current application badge number (0 to clear badge)."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports the current badge count to Pushwoosh for analytics and to enable"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"badge-based segmentation. This is useful for:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics"}]},{"text":": Track user engagement through unread counts","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Segmentation"}]},{"text":": Target users with high\/low badge counts","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Badge management","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Allow server-side badge manipulation"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this method whenever you update the app badge to keep Pushwoosh in sync.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sync badge with Pushwoosh when updating unread counts:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class NotificationBadgeManager {","","    private(set) var unreadCount: Int = 0 {","        didSet {","            updateBadge()","        }","    }","","    func markAsRead(_ notificationIds: [String]) {","        unreadCount = max(0, unreadCount - notificationIds.count)","    }","","    func handleNewNotification() {","        unreadCount += 1","    }","","    func clearAll() {","        unreadCount = 0","    }","","    private func updateBadge() {","        \/\/ Update system badge","        if #available(iOS 16.0, *) {","            UNUserNotificationCenter.current().setBadgeCount(unreadCount)","        } else {","            UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = unreadCount","        }","","        \/\/ Sync with Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(unreadCount)","    }","}","","\/\/ Usage in AppDelegate","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive(_ application: UIApplication) {","        \/\/ Sync current badge state when app becomes active","        let currentBadge = application.applicationIconBadgeNumber","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(currentBadge)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","title":"sendBadges:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendBadges:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/sendBadges:":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendbadges:","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Synchronizes the application badge number with Pushwoosh servers."}],"type":"topic","title":"sendBadges:","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendBadges:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendBadges:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"}}}